# The v1.0.0 build has the export libraries (jszip, FileSaver, jsPDF, jspdf-autotable)
# vendored inline as minified source, so the file is byte-sensitive in a way the older
# builds were not. core.autocrlf is on for this repo, which would rewrite the newlines
# inside those minified payloads on checkout — a stray \r inside a JS string literal is
# a data change, not a formatting one, and it would land in generated PDFs.
#
# -text disables all newline translation, so what is committed, what Netlify deploys,
# and what was verified in the browser are the same bytes.
TheatreCuePlayer_v1.0.0.html -text
